{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2023-05-24 07:00:00', 'title': 'MOSAIC ANNOUNCES NEW $700 MILLION TERM LOAN FACILITY', 'text': 'TAMPA, FL / ACCESSWIRE / MAY 24, 2023 / THE MOSAIC COMPANY (NYSE:MOS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS CLOSED ON A NEW $700 MILLION 10-YEAR TERM LOAN FACILITY THROUGH THE FARM CREDIT SYSTEM. UNIQUELY AVAILABLE TO AGRIBUSINESS PARTICIPANTS, THIS FACILITY PROVIDES ATTRACTIVE TERMS THAT INCLUDE A DELAYED DRAW OPTION AND PREPAYMENT WITH NO PENALTY.'}